/* 半屏表单弹层（观感对齐 pages/footprints 既有的 .mask/.sheet：同色遮罩、24rpx 圆角、底部弹出） */
.fp-mask {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  z-index: 100;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
}
.fp-sheet {
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 24rpx 24rpx 0 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.fp-head {
  flex: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx 8rpx;
}
.fp-title {
  flex: 1;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1f2329;
}
.fp-close {
  flex: none;
  padding: 8rpx 0 8rpx 24rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #999;
}
.fp-body {
  flex: 1;
  min-height: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 16rpx 32rpx calc(24rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

/* —— 以下表单样式与 components/marker-form、app.wxss 既有表单卡片风格对齐 —— */
.field-label {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: #666;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}
.field-input {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;
}
.field-tip {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  font-size: 22rpx;
}

/* 地点 */
.loc-picked {
  background: #eef4ff;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 20rpx 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 20rpx;
}
.loc-name {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: #1f2329;
  font-weight: 500;
}
.loc-address {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
}
.loc-empty-tip {
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}
.loc-actions {
  display: flex;
}
.loc-btn {
  flex: 1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 20rpx 0;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  color: #2b6cf6;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}
.loc-btn:last-child {
  margin-right: 0;
}
.loc-btn-hover {
  background: #eef4ff;
}

/* 日期 picker */
.picker-value {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 0;
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid #eee;
  color: #1f2329;
}

/* 同行的人 */
.people-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.people-input {
  flex: 1;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
}
.people-add {
  padding: 12rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #eef4ff;
  color: #2b6cf6;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}
.people-add-hover {
  background: #dce7fd;
}
.people-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16rpx;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
}
.people-tag {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 10rpx 20rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}
.tag-x {
  margin-left: 10rpx;
  color: #999;
  font-size: 30rpx;
}

/* 描述 */
.desc-input {
  width: 100%;
  height: 160rpx;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 20rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

/* 图片九宫格（度量对齐 components/marker-form） */
.photo-grid {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.photo-item {
  position: relative;
  width: 160rpx;
  height: 160rpx;
  margin: 0 16rpx 16rpx 0;
}
.photo-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
}
.photo-remove {
  position: absolute;
  top: -12rpx;
  right: -12rpx;
  width: 44rpx;
  height: 44rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
  text-align: center;
}
.photo-add {
  width: 160rpx;
  height: 160rpx;
  border: 2rpx dashed #ccc;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #999;
  font-size: 56rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.photo-add-hover {
  background: #f7f8fa;
  color: #2b6cf6;
}

/* 提交按钮 */
.submit-btn {
  width: 100%;
  height: 88rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  line-height: 1;
  font-size: 32rpx;
  margin-top: 8rpx;
}
.submit-btn[disabled] {
  background: #cdd8f0;
  color: #fff;
}
.submit-tip {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 16rpx;
}
